id: pm-gllxud
title: Reject mixed-type MCP mutation arrays before CSV normalization
description: "PR1541 inline review4343775875 identified an atomic-admission gap in the new MCP preflight: normalizeMcpOptionsArrays joins tags arrays before typed validation. Independent modern public stdio reproduction against ccd22de confirms tags=[valid,4] with a sibling title returns changed_field_count2 and persists tags=[4,valid] plus title=partial. Validate declared array-to-CSV mutation inputs before conversion, preserving valid string arrays and nested precedence. This review-remediation child continues the closed implementation lineage without changing its completed source changes."
