author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: Reproduce mixed tags through public MCP before the fix; Reject malformed arrays for create and update before CSV conversion with exact unchanged durable snapshots; Preserve valid string arrays and nested option precedence; Retrigger all configured reviewers after the revised push and retain strict CI coverage gates
parent: pm-gh1538
risk: medium
confidence: 100
severity: medium
resolution: Validate merged MCP create/update CSV-array values before conversion; reject non-string entries atomically while preserving nested precedence and valid empty/string arrays.
expected_result: "Mixed-type mutation arrays refuse before any item/history write, while valid string arrays and explicit nested replacements retain their semantics."
actual_result: "Both committed regressions fail before the guard and pass afterward. Malformed flat/nested create and update arrays preserve exact durable snapshots; nested valid arrays replace malformed flat values, and empty arrays remain valid. The public stdio control returns changed=false and retains original values. All nine linked tests and the full 10,982-test coverage run pass at 100/100/100/100; fresh hosted security/static checks and review are required for merge."
